name etaremune
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Reverse-counting enumerate environment
relocated 1
longdesc The package implements the etaremune environment which is an
longdesc enumerate environment in which the labels decrease instead of
longdesc increasing. The package is noticeably more efficient than the
longdesc revnum package, which uses painfully many counters.
runfiles size=1
